@owner = massielcr
@repo = my-test-http-repo


### PostAsync(String, HttpContent)                                    ----      Create a Personal Repository via GitHub REST API

POST {{HostAddress}}/postasync/repos  HTTP/2
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "my-test-http-repo",
  "description": "Created using an .http file!",
  "private": false,
  "auto_init": true,
  "has_downloads": true
}

### PostAsync(String, HttpContent, CancellationToken)                 ----      Create Issues in Personal Repository via GitHub REST API

POST {{HostAddress}}/postasync/repos/{{owner}}/{{repo}}/issues?count=1&cid=1  HTTP/2
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "title": "Found a bug",
  "body": "I'm having a problem with this."
}


### PostAsync(Uri, HttpContent)                                       ----      Create a Personal Repository via GitHub REST API

POST {{HostAddress}}/postasync/repos
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
User-Agent: MyTestService
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "my-test-http-repo",
  "description": "Created using an .http file!",
  "private": true,
  "auto_init": true
}


### PostAsync(Uri, HttpContent, CancellationToken)                    ----      Create a Personal Repository via GitHub REST API

POST {{HostAddress}}/postasync/repos
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
User-Agent: MyTestService
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "my-test-http-repo",
  "description": "Created using an .http file!",
  "private": true,
  "auto_init": true
}
